      <description><![CDATA[
        Anthropic is breaking ranks with Silicon Valley&#39;s voluntary pledges, circulating a draft US federal bill that gives courts the power to block dangerous AI deployments. Here is what this means for global tech governance.
        
        [SPLIT]
        ⚡ The proposal mandates frontier developers to conduct rigorous pre-deployment testing, public transparency reporting, independent evaluations, and robust security programs.
        [SPLIT]
        ⚡ The initiative disrupts Washington&#39;s reliance on voluntary industry pledges and executive orders designed to sustain the current economic AI boom.
