      <description><![CDATA[
        San Francisco lab Anthropic updates its usage policy to ban users from treating its Claude AI system with &#39;needless cruelty&#39; amid growing debates on machine consciousness.
        
        [SPLIT]
        ⚡ The policy relies on the AI&#39;s built-in capability to terminate hostile or toxic user interactions.
        [SPLIT]
        ⚡ Executives like Dario Amodei have previously expressed openness regarding the speculative possibility of machine consciousness.
